  "title": "Statement on Papua LNG project",
  "summary": "The 12 banks mentioned by Reclaim Finance are not involved in the financing plan for Papua LNG, which is progressing as scheduled. In response to Reclaim Finance’s allegations, TotalEnergies reaffirms that the Papua LNG project is committed to respecting the Papua New Guinean national legislation, the Equator Principles as well as the Performance Standards (PS) […]",
